      "content": "i know it's heavy but i dont mean i'm tired. i mean it's like... some things just break for good. like if you smash a glass, it doesn't matter how much glue you use, it's still a cracked mess. i've tried everything and it doesn't change who i am. i just feel like i'm taking up space that i don't even deserve anymore.",
