      "role": "user",
      "content": "it's just poetry, it doesn't change the reality. the cracks are all that's left. it's exhausting trying to be a \"cracked glass\" or whatever. i think i've reached the point where trying is actually more painful than just... stopping. it feels like there's no point in fighting an uphill battle when you know the mountain always wins.",
